iện ít nhiễu WiFi hơn – Giảm thiểu nhiễu từ các tín hiệu lân cận để cải thiện hiệu quả truyền dẫn với BSS\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003eKết nối thông minh– Chọn băng tần khả dụng tốt nhất cho từng thiết bị một cách thông minh\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/bf/0b/0a/04b0107396222f972cdfba89ce348644.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/00/7d/6e/f6cb5baee18eaaf64daa389341f8789a.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"545\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/dc/3c/45/15a9f010cdd08728e80c69067b64b148.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003cimg title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/87/01/0f/2837a3092c461fa884684b11ea6c6e95.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003cimg title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/94/79/2b/5540717177703a7d59913843e5e4b137.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003cimg title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/3c/81/d2/78cc588e23840b542d9f4cc0f37f694b.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003cimg title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/f2/8f/09/13f949e51ae648f327e60ad1954359a8.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003cimg title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/38/cc/4b/a0c497ae63c296a0e43aecdbc1b49154.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003cimg title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/62/08/6d/d362c66ab66481e0d8764af256329e71.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003cimg title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/4b/86/3a/fe89ca861542e25525ea28a44a1365e7.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003cimg title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/92/45/d3/8b35be17445dbb8eaca370183e3eb94d.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=